      "question": "Does acetylfluorene m38 interpolate reliably after its large 20/1 transfer failure? The 100 mg, 10/1 candidate predicts 18.18/32.87 mL and preserves the measured 5/1 and 20/1 setup, including the 1000 uL DCM plug. It separates onset delay from interval widening without adding a loading confound."
    },
    {
