      "question": "How much of low-dose m141 retention has developed by 5/1? This 46 mg candidate predicts 17.60/42.11 mL, completes an interior point on its measured low-dose curve and directly contrasts the observed 138 mg 5/1 condition. It can answer both curvature and local loading questions with one label."
